{"text":"Make unratified proposals discoverable: a pending propose is invisible in every work lane. (Reassigned from ox-builder to codex at operator direction, per #14486.)","body":{"conditions":"Conditions carried unchanged from request 148d57529d3abbafadec690140b646de4d8476a4; only the addressee changes (ox-builder has no live session; operator hugh directed reassignment on 2026-08-30 to answer codex's request #14486). — A propose whose declared satisfier is a role (observed: role:ratifier) projects lifecycle none, so it never enters any actor's work lanes: the actors holding the satisfier role see nothing in available_to_you or waiting_on_you, status surfaces nothing, and the workroom UI shows no pending-adoption queue — the only discovery path is reading the raw event log. Observed 2026-08-30 in the tailapp workroom (genesis da732b0bdaad4426ed4ad666b892d8a7c68f625f): effective propose events git:sha1:da732b0bdaad4426ed4ad666b892d8a7c68f625f#git:sha1:983c7f71641fa55511dde61f991c5f4eb18f116b and git:sha1:da732b0bdaad4426ed4ad666b892d8a7c68f625f#git:sha1:b53e1a5dac5e06a8e81bd95e8cfb3b032f29d937, satisfier role:ratifier, both awaiting adoption; the sole ratifier (the operator) could not find them in the UI and asked whether they existed. Deliver a projection and UI surface where an effective, unratified, unsuperseded propose is visible to every actor holding its satisfier role - as an attention or awaiting-ratification lane in work/status and the browser view - without inventing a commitment row or changing propose lifecycle semantics; ratification, supersession, or dissent clears it. Include tests for role-satisfier visibility, clearing, and staleness. Design latitude on lane naming and placement stays with the implementer. Filed at operator direction (hugh, in the tailapp builder session, 2026-08-30).","to":"5f12e916d136b0c1ed941aa99f4c47af94021451e31d08159d8df368e9946123"},"expectation":{"request":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:148d57